    "body": "For the failure scenario,\n\n``` html\n<script>\n  var b = document.createElement(\"base\")\n  b.href = \"//test:test\"\n  w(b.href)\n</script>\n```\n\nFirefox returns the given value, but Chrome and Safari return the empty string. Don't have Edge.\n",
