    "updated_at": "2016-04-19T08:23:59Z",
    "body": "Apart from the failure scenario (for which the PR matches Safari/Chrome, but should probably be updated to match Firefox per @zcorpan's comment), the PR matches Edge (I'm assuming you have some copypasta and Edge actually logs a trailing slash as well for the final test).\n\nCurrently the PR also takes into account a \"frozen base URL\" if the element has one, so that when CSP applies the `href` getter returns the fallback base URL and not the base URL that was blocked, but I should probably simply remove that since it's not worth the complexity (just use `document.baseURI` if you want to know the base URL).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
